 "files": {},
 "strandsDrawing": {
  "alt": "Six steps in a loop: record episodes with DatasetRecorder, verify the parquet with verify_dataset, label episodes with predicates and a judge, train a checkpoint with create_trainer from a TrainSpec, deploy it with create_policy and run_policy in the simulator and then behind the gate on the arm, measure with eval_policy or labels; the measured number returns as the next recording target."
 }
}